{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23426","headline":"对火翫雪 · 白居易","name":"对火翫雪","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生所心爱，爱火兼怜雪。\n火是腊天春，雪爲阴夜月。\n鹅毛纷正堕，兽炭敲初折。\n盈尺白盐寒，满炉红玉热。\n稍宜杯酌动，渐引笙歌发。\n但识欢来由，不知醉时节。\n银盘堆柳絮，罗袖抟琼屑。\n共愁明日销，便作经年别。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23426.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23426","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}